WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit in Staff Pose. Bend the right knee and place the foot by the right sitting bone.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Reach the right arm inside the right shin and wrap it around the shin.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Reach the left arm behind the back and clasp the hands or a strap.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Inhale length, exhale fold over the extended left leg.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then unwind and switch sides.
